ification, risk classification, escalation criteria", "reason_behind_concept": "Escalation decisions must be based on observed evidence and consequence, not assumptions about system failure or root cause.", "implementation_context_when_to_use": "Use when evidence issues may prevent safe next-step AI/ML work or require support from another owner."}, "student_confusion": "Which issues are minor observations and which are blockers?", "artifact_submitted": false, "completion_percentage": 0, "engineering_workflow_stage": "Risk & Escalation", "module_specific_problem_statement": "You now sees that missing temperature values may hide thermal anomalies, rpm gaps may weaken pattern detection, duplicate timestamps may create false anomaly spikes, packet jumps may indicate dropped data, and unclear field metadata may lead to wrong features. You must classify which issues are minor, which are blockers, what the consequence is, and whether the issue belongs to AI/ML, software, embedded, test, or senior engineering escalation."}, {"id": "mod-aiml-tel-l1-m5", "title": "Quality, Communication & Closure", "tools": {"tools_used": "Closure report template, reviewer checklist", "tool_type_free_or_paid": "free"}, "stages": [{"key": "engage", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}, {"key": "explore", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}, {"key": "explain", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}, {"key": "express", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}, {"key": "empower", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}, {"key": "evolve", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}], "status": "available", "content": [{"id": "c-aiml-tel-l1-m5-empower", "url": "https://storage-sp.rareminds.in/LTE/aiml/Mod5_01_Artifact.pptx", "order": 5, "stage": "empower", "title": "M5 Empower: Final Quality and Closure Report submission: professional readiness closure", "status": "published", "isViewed": false, "facilitator": [{"question": "AI coach fo