 parts of this baseline workflow can I decide, and which parts need senior or system-team confirmation?", "artifact_submitted": false, "completion_percentage": 0, "engineering_workflow_stage": "Baseline Case Intake", "module_specific_problem_statement": "The senior engineer asks for a baseline anomaly workflow, but the request is still broad. You must clarify what anomaly means for this case, which fields are allowed, why status_code is excluded, what assumptions are acceptable, and what output format will be useful for later C++/Qt display planning. You must define what AI/ML can decide and what needs software, embedded, or senior engineer confirmation."}, {"id": "mod-aiml-tel-l2-m2", "title": "Evidence / Requirement Validation", "tools": {"tools_used": "Spreadsheet filter/sort, model evidence checklist, basic data scan", "tool_type_free_or_paid": "free"}, "stages": [{"key": "engage", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}, {"key": "explore", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}, {"key": "explain", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}, {"key": "express", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}, {"key": "empower", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}, {"key": "evolve", "status": "not_started", "time_spent_seconds": 0}], "status": "available", "content": [{"id": "c-aiml-tel-l2-m2-empower", "url": "https://content.rareminds.dev/courses/aiml-tel-l2/content/c-aiml-tel-l2-m2-empower", "order": 5, "stage": "empower", "title": "Decision check: is the cleaned sample fit for beginner baseline testing?", "status": "published", "isViewed": false, "facilitator": [{"question": "AI coach for L2 Model Evidence Validation Checklist: Based on your checklist, is the cleaned sample fit for beginner baseline testing, limited testing, or blocked?", "follow_up": "Decide whether the cleaned sample is suitable for beginner baseline testing, needs fixes, escalation, or blocking."}], "content_type": "decision check", "duration_secon