s.dev/courses/aiml-tel-l5/content/c-aiml-tel-l5-m0-explore", "order": 2, "stage": "explore", "title": "Inspect evidence for solution readiness sheet", "status": "published", "isViewed": false, "facilitator": [{"question": "AI coach for L5 Solution Readiness Sheet: What visible evidence should you inspect before completing this artifact?", "follow_up": "Point to module-specific evidence: L1-L4 evidence chain, 720-row original pack, 690-row cleaned sample, 26 anomaly flags, integration schema, revised LLM report, risk register, governance boundary"}], "content_type": "practice activity", "duration_seconds": 900}, {"id": "c-aiml-tel-l5-m0-express", "url": "https://content.rareminds.dev/courses/aiml-tel-l5/content/c-aiml-tel-l5-m0-express", "order": 4, "stage": "express", "title": "Template task: complete the L5 Solution Readiness Sheet", "status": "published", "isViewed": false, "facilitator": [{"question": "AI coach for L5 Solution Readiness Sheet: What exactly will you write in the artifact so it is useful to a reviewer?", "follow_up": "Include the required fields: L5 purpose, full workflow map, L1-L4 evidence summary, decision-support boundary, human review requirement, governance awareness, readiness decision"}], "content_type": "worksheet", "duration_seconds": 1200}], "support": {"ai_support_tips": "Ask AI to help summarize how L1-L4 artifacts connect, then decide the solution boundary yourself using evidence.", "module_continuity_link": "Creates the Solution Readiness Sheet that becomes the context input for end-to-end case intake."}, "artifacts": {"empower": {"id": "ma-aiml-tel-l5-m0-f", "questions": [{"id": "aq-aiml-tel-l5-m0-f1", "order": 1, "title": "L5 Solution Readiness Sheet", "description": "Can you explain how data readiness, baseline workflow, integration, reporting, and governance connect in the full solution?", "instructions": "Complete the final artifact by answering: Can you explain how data readiness, baseline workflow, integration, reporting, and 