hip, or risk wording. Do not ask AI to approve the requisition or invent missing values.", "module_continuity_link": "Creates the Requisition Readiness Sheet, which feeds the next module and preserves the evidence trail for Guided Requisition Intake and Readiness Check."}, "artifacts": {"empower": {"id": "ma-mba-hr-req-l1-m0-f", "questions": [{"id": "aq-mba-hr-req-l1-m0-f1", "order": 1, "title": "Final Submission: Requisition Readiness Sheet", "description": "Can you complete the Requisition Readiness Sheet using the module evidence and show a defensible MBA HR requisition decision without assuming missing approval, budget, ownership, or launch information?", "instructions": "Use the existing template fields for Requisition Readiness Sheet. Required evidence: Workflow map, stakeholder map, HR-owned checks, manager-owned inputs, finance approval need, ATS readiness requirements, readiness gaps. For final submission, cite the specific case evidence from this level, write the decision in workplace language, and make clear whether the item is ready, partially ready, hold/split/escalate, conditionally acceptable, audit-ready, or blocked as relevant. Use AI only for guided questions and clarity checks, not for final approval or invented details.", "accepted_file_types": ["xlsx", "docx", "pdf", "zip"], "submission_required": true, "expected_submission_type": "Excel + PDF"}], "templates": [{"id": "at-mba-hr-req-l1-m0", "version": 1, "file_url": "https://storage-sp.rareminds.in/LTE/mba/mod0_02_%20artifact%20template%20.xlsx", "file_name": "mod0_02_artifact_template.xlsx", "file_type": "xlsx", "artifact_id": "ma-mba-hr-req-l1-m0-f", "question_id": "aq-mba-hr-req-l1-m0-f1", "is_downloadable": true}], "submissions": [], "total_score": 100, "max_attempts": 3, "artifact_type": "final", "passing_score": 70, "allow_resubmission": true, "require_review_unlock": true}, "express": {"id": "ma-mba-hr-req-l1-m0-p", "questions": [{"id": "aq-mba-hr-req-l1-m0-p1", "order": 1, "title": "Prac