mat&fit=crop", "required_level": 3, "capability_name": "Hiring Demand to Approved Requisition Launch", "difficulty_level": "beginner-plus", "job_pathway_role": "MBA HR / Talent Acquisition Associate", "problem_artifacts": [{"id": "pa-mba-hr-req-l2-m0", "no": 1, "text": "", "score": 0, "title": "L2 ATS Draft Readiness Sheet", "module": "Industry, Role & Course Readiness", "prompt": "Final artifact question: Can you complete the L2 ATS Draft Readiness Sheet using the module evidence and show a defensible MBA HR requisition decision without assuming missing approval, budget, ownership, or launch information? Input: use the Routine Requisition Preparation and ATS Drafting case problem, module scenario, and relevant source evidence for approved hiring form to ATS draft flow. Action: complete the L2 ATS Draft Readiness Sheet by filling these required fields: Approved hiring form, required ATS fields, budget proof, stakeholder map, launch-readiness checklist. Evidence to cite: Approved hiring form, required ATS fields, budget proof, stakeholder map, launch-readiness checklist. Also cite the concrete case facts from this level, including role counts, approvals, exceptions, defects, audit records, or governance indicators where applicable. Output decision: state the module-appropriate decision such as ready, partially ready, hold, split, escalate, ready after correction, conditionally acceptable with controls, audit-ready, or blocked. Do not invent missing values, bypass approval evidence, launch unapproved roles, hide risks, or ask AI to make the final HR decision.", "status": "not_started"}, {"id": "pa-mba-hr-req-l2-m1", "no": 2, "text": "", "score": 0, "title": "L2 Requisition Case Intake Note", "module": "Case Intake & Role Boundary", "prompt": "Final artifact question: Can you complete the L2 Requisition Case Intake Note using the module evidence and show a defensible MBA HR requisition decision without assuming missing approval, budget, ownership, or launch information