th assumptions, or blocked by reset, signal-width, valid-range, CDC ownership, or memory-map gaps."}, "artifacts": {"empower": {"id": "ma-emb-fpga-l1-m5-f", "questions": [{"id": "aq-emb-fpga-l1-m5-f1", "order": 1, "title": "Quality and Closure Report", "description": "Is the final closure message clear about what was checked, what remains limited, what decision is defensible, and what the next team should do?", "instructions": "Complete the final artifact by answering the workplace artifact question: Is the final closure message clear about what was checked, what remains limited, what decision is defensible, and what the next team should do? Fill the required workbook fields fully: Work completed; evidence used; checks passed; checks failed; open issues; closure message; confidence level; closure decision. Reviewer expectation: Checks whether you communicate a clear, honest closure decision without overclaiming readiness. Submit with visible evidence, reasoning clarity, correct L1 role boundary, escalation where needed, limitation language, and artifact completeness. Do not use AI to produce the final answer; use AI only as a coach for guided questions and clarity checks. Level-specific review correction: The closure must state the readiness decision clearly and explain whether the evidence is ready, partially ready with assumptions, or blocked by reset, signal-width, valid-range, CDC ownership, or memory-map gaps.", "accepted_file_types": [".xlsx", ".docx", ".pdf", ".zip"], "submission_required": true, "expected_submission_type": "file"}], "templates": [{"id": "at-emb-fpga-l1-m5", "version": 1, "file_url": "https://storage-sp.rareminds.in/LTE/embedd/mod5_02_template.xlsx", "file_name": "mod5_02_template.xlsx", "file_type": "xlsx", "artifact_id": "ma-emb-fpga-l1-m5-f", "question_id": "aq-emb-fpga-l1-m5-f1", "is_downloadable": true}], "submissions": [], "total_score": 100, "max_attempts": 3, "artifact_type": "final", "passing_score": 70, "allow_resubmission": true, "