s; unknowns; assumptions; role boundary; clarification questions; intake decision. Reviewer expectation: Checks whether you converted a vague workplace request into a scoped technical case with clear assumptions and questions. Submit with visible evidence, reasoning clarity, correct L3 role boundary, escalation where needed, limitation language, and artifact completeness. Do not use AI to produce the final answer; use AI only as a coach for guided questions and clarity checks. Level-specific review correction: You clarifies what AI/embedded integration evidence is available and what must be confirmed by software, FPGA, memory-interface, or senior integration owners.", "accepted_file_types": [".xlsx", ".docx", ".pdf", ".zip"], "submission_required": true, "expected_submission_type": "file"}], "templates": [{"id": "at-emb-fpga-l3-m1", "version": 1, "file_url": "https://content.rareminds.dev/templates/emb-fpga-l3/ART_L3_M1_Integration_Case_Intake_Template", "file_name": "ART_L3_M1_Integration_Case_Intake_Template", "file_type": "xlsx", "artifact_id": "ma-emb-fpga-l3-m1-f", "question_id": "aq-emb-fpga-l3-m1-f1", "is_downloadable": true}], "submissions": [], "total_score": 100, "max_attempts": 3, "artifact_type": "final", "passing_score": 70, "allow_resubmission": true, "require_review_unlock": true}, "express": {"id": "ma-emb-fpga-l3-m1-p", "questions": [{"id": "aq-emb-fpga-l3-m1-p1", "order": 1, "title": "Practice Draft: L3 Integration Case Intake Note", "description": "Has you converted the senior engineer request into a scoped case intake by separating facts, assumptions, unknowns, role ownership, and clarification questions?", "instructions": "Draft a first pass using the full module problem and required fields: Case request; available inputs; missing information; knowns; unknowns; assumptions; role boundary; clarification questions; intake decision.. Think through the evidence manually first and use AI only as a coach for questions, clarity checks, missed-risk prom