pected actual evidence gaps and made a defensible proceed, retry, or block decision. Submit with visible evidence, reasoning clarity, correct L4 role boundary, escalation where needed, limitation language, and artifact completeness. Do not use AI to produce the final answer; use AI only as a coach for guided questions and clarity checks. Level-specific review correction: Negative slack of WNS -0.42 ns and 23 violated timing paths block timing-confidence claims until timing closure evidence or targeted optimization evidence is provided. You should also note the 5.8 Gbps vs 6.25 Gbps throughput gap as an approximately 7.2% shortfall.", "accepted_file_types": [".xlsx", ".docx", ".pdf", ".zip"], "submission_required": true, "expected_submission_type": "file"}], "templates": [{"id": "at-emb-fpga-l4-m2", "version": 1, "file_url": "https://content.rareminds.dev/templates/emb-fpga-l4/ART_L4_M2_Timing_Evidence_Validation_Template", "file_name": "ART_L4_M2_Timing_Evidence_Validation_Template", "file_type": "xlsx", "artifact_id": "ma-emb-fpga-l4-m2-f", "question_id": "aq-emb-fpga-l4-m2-f1", "is_downloadable": true}], "submissions": [], "total_score": 100, "max_attempts": 3, "artifact_type": "final", "passing_score": 70, "allow_resubmission": true, "require_review_unlock": true}, "express": {"id": "ma-emb-fpga-l4-m2-p", "questions": [{"id": "aq-emb-fpga-l4-m2-p1", "order": 1, "title": "Practice Draft: L4 Timing Evidence Validation Checklist", "description": "Has you validated the actual engineering evidence for timing closure, performance validation, utilization, CDC, and interface reliability control using the required fields: Evidence item; source/owner; completeness check; consistency check; mismatch/gap count; impact on design or validation; readiness decision.? You review timing-closure evidence and performance risk; they do not perform timing closure or claim implementation sign-off.", "instructions": "Draft a first pass using the full module problem and required fields: 