readiness checklist."}], "content_type": "worksheet", "duration_seconds": 1800}], "support": {"ai_support_tips": "Ask AI as a coach to test your clarity, missing evidence, stakeholder ownership, or risk wording. Do not ask AI to approve the requisition or invent missing values.", "module_continuity_link": "Creates the L2 ATS Draft Readiness Sheet, which feeds the next module and preserves the evidence trail for Routine Requisition Preparation and ATS Drafting."}, "artifacts": {"empower": {"id": "ma-mba-hr-req-l2-m0-f", "questions": [{"id": "aq-mba-hr-req-l2-m0-f1", "order": 1, "title": "Final Submission: L2 ATS Draft Readiness Sheet", "description": "Can you complete the L2 ATS Draft Readiness Sheet using the module evidence and show a defensible MBA HR requisition decision without assuming missing approval, budget, ownership, or launch information?", "instructions": "Use the existing template fields for L2 ATS Draft Readiness Sheet. Required evidence: Approved hiring form, required ATS fields, budget proof, stakeholder map, launch-readiness checklist. For final submission, cite the specific case evidence from this level, write the decision in workplace language, and make clear whether the item is ready, partially ready, hold/split/escalate, conditionally acceptable, audit-ready, or blocked as relevant. Use AI only for guided questions and clarity checks, not for final approval or invented details.", "accepted_file_types": ["xlsx", "docx", "pdf", "zip"], "submission_required": true, "expected_submission_type": "Excel + PDF"}], "templates": [{"id": "at-mba-hr-req-l2-m0", "version": 1, "file_url": "https://content.rareminds.dev/templates/mba-hr-req-l2/ART_HR_REQ_L2_M0_Readiness_Template", "file_name": "ART_HR_REQ_L2_M0_Readiness_Template", "file_type": "xlsx", "artifact_id": "ma-mba-hr-req-l2-m0-f", "question_id": "aq-mba-hr-req-l2-m0-f1", "is_downloadable": true}], "submissions": [], "total_score": 100, "max_attempts": 3, "artifact_type": "final", "passing_score": 70