on."}], "content_type": "explainer", "duration_seconds": 1200}, {"id": "c-mba-hr-req-l2-m6-explore", "url": "https://content.rareminds.dev/courses/mba-hr-req-l2/content/c-mba-hr-req-l2-m6-explore", "order": 2, "stage": "explore", "title": "Portfolio, Transfer & Final Validation: Evidence inspection activity for show the requisition was drafted from approved evidence", "status": "published", "isViewed": false, "facilitator": [{"question": "AI coach for L2 Requisition Preparation Portfolio: Which source evidence can you point to before making a requisition decision?", "follow_up": "Cite a visible document, tracker, approval note, ATS field, defect record, or audit comment rather than giving a general opinion. Module focus: show the requisition was drafted from approved evidence. Artifact evidence: Intake note, validation checklist, ATS action note, risk note, closure report, reviewer validation."}], "content_type": "practice activity", "duration_seconds": 1200}, {"id": "c-mba-hr-req-l2-m6-express", "url": "https://content.rareminds.dev/courses/mba-hr-req-l2/content/c-mba-hr-req-l2-m6-express", "order": 4, "stage": "express", "title": "Portfolio, Transfer & Final Validation: Artifact drafting activity for show the requisition was drafted from approved evidence", "status": "published", "isViewed": false, "facilitator": [{"question": "AI coach for L2 Requisition Preparation Portfolio: What exactly will you write in the artifact so the reviewer can see your evidence?", "follow_up": "Write the artifact entry as a reviewer-ready workplace note with evidence, owner, decision, and next action. Module focus: show the requisition was drafted from approved evidence. Artifact evidence: Intake note, validation checklist, ATS action note, risk note, closure report, reviewer validation."}], "content_type": "worksheet", "duration_seconds": 1800}], "support": {"ai_support_tips": "Ask AI as a coach to test your clarity, missing evidence, stakeholder ownership, or risk wording. Do not ask AI to approve the requisition or invent missing values.", "module_continuity_link": "Creates the L2 Requisition Preparation Portfolio, which feeds the next module and preserves the evidence trail for Routine Requisition Preparation and ATS Drafting."}, "artifacts": {"empower": {"id": "ma-mba-hr-req-l2-m6-f", "questions": [{"id": "aq-mba-hr-req-l2-m6-f1", "order": 1, "title": "Final Submission: L2 Requisition Preparation Portfolio", "description": "Can you complete the L2 Requisition Preparation Portfolio using the module evidence and show a defensible MBA HR requisition decision without assuming missing approval, budget, ownership, or launch information?", "instructions": "Use the existing template fields for L2 Requisition Preparation Portfolio. Required evidence: Intake note, validation checklist, ATS action note, risk note, closure report, reviewer validation. For final submission, cite the specific case evidence from this level, write the decision in workplace language, and make clear whether the item is ready, partially ready, hold/split/escalate, conditionally acceptable, audit-ready, or blocked as relevant. Use AI only for guided questions and clarity checks, not for final approval or invented details.", "accepted_file_types": ["xlsx", "docx", "pdf", "zip"], "submission_required": true, "expected_submission_type": "ZIP + PDF"}], "templates": [{"id": "at-mba-hr-req-l2-m6", "version": 1, "file_url": "https://content.rareminds.dev/templates/mba-hr-req-l2/ART_HR_REQ_L2_M6_Portfolio_Template", "file_name": "ART_HR_REQ_L2_M6_Portfolio_Template", "file_type": "docx", "artifact_id": "ma-mba-hr-req-l2-m6-f", "question_id": "aq-mba-hr-req-l2-m6-f1", "is_downloadable": true}], "submissions": [], "total_score": 100, "max_attempts": 3, "artifact_type": "final", "passing_score": 70, "allow_resubmission": true, "require_review_unlock": true}, "express": {"id": "ma-mba-hr-req-l2-m6-p", "questions": [{"id": "aq-mba-hr-req-l2-m6-p1", "order": 1, "title": "Practice Draft: L2 Requisition Preparation Portfolio", "description": "Can you complete the L2 Requisition Preparation Portfolio using the module evidence and show a defensible MBA HR requisition decision without assuming missing approval, budget, ownership, or launch information?", "instructions": "Use the existing template fields for L2 Requisition Preparation Portfolio. Required evidence: Intake note, validation checklist, ATS action note, risk note, closure report, reviewer validation. For final submission, cite the specific case evidence from this level, write the decision in workplace language, and make clear whether the item is ready, partially ready, hold/split/escalate, conditionally acceptable, audit-ready, or blocked as relevant. Use AI only for guided questions and clarity checks, not for final approval or invented details.", "submission_required": false, "expected_submission_type": "text"}], "templates": [], "submissions": [], "total_score": 0, "max_attempts": null, "artifact_type": "practice", "passing_score": null, "allow_resubmission": true, "require_review_unlock": false}}, "knowledge": {"technical_concepts_learnt": "Portfolio chain, evidence map, retry log, transfer note, final reviewer validation", "academic_refresher_concepts": "Reflective practice, portfolio evidence, competency demonstration, workplace transfer"}, "module_no": 6, "description": "Build the L2 Requisition Preparation Portfolio by completing the MBA HR requisition task: You compile proof that the requisition was launched from approved evidence, not assumptions. Required evidence inside the artifact: Intake note, validation checklist, ATS action note, risk note, closure report, reviewer validation.", "estimatedTime": "2 hrs", "pressure_points": "You may submit separate artifacts without showing a connected evidence chain from intake to final recommendation. In this level, focus on show the requisition was drafted from approved evidence.", "learning_content": {"major_concepts": "Portfolio evidence, a